o has orchestrated a campaign of bombings while eluding the most sophisticated intelligence network in the world. To lure the terrorist out into the open, Ferris will have to penetrate his murky world, but the closer Ferris gets to the target, the more he discovers that trust is both a dangerous commodity and the only one that will get him out alive.","genres":["Action","Thriller"]}],"info":[{"title":"Information","items":[{"title":"Studio","info":"Warner Bros."},{"title":"Released","info":"2008"},{"title":"Run Time","info":"2 hr 8 min"},{"title":"Rated","info":"R for strong violence, including some torture and language throughout."},{"title":"Content Advisories","info":"Sexual Content, Violence, Suggestive Dialogue, Language"},{"title":"Region of Origin","info":"United States"},{"title":null,"info":"© 2008 Red de Mentiras (Body of Lies), © 2009 Warner Bros. Entertainment Inc."}]},{"title":"Languages","items":[{"title":"Original Audio","info":"English, French, French (France)"},{"title":"Audio","info":"English (AAC, ⁨Dolby 5.1⁩), Spanish (Latin America) (AAC, ⁨Dolby 5.1⁩)"},{"title":"Subtitles","info":"English (CC), Spanish (Latin America) "}]},{"title":"Accessibility","items":[{"title":"(cc)","info":"Closed captions (CC) refer to subtitles in the available language with the addition of relevant non-dialogue information."}]}]}